# Strata's .env: copy to .env (git ignores it) and fill in what you use; chmod 600 .env (it holds keys).
# A convenience on top of the run config (strata-*.json), never in its place: nothing here is written back, and
# a key or MCP server set in the config, on the command line or in the chat page stays as it is.

# One more API key for http://<host>:8090/v1 and the chat page (accepted next to the config's "api_key";
# Strata.app and the TUI send it when their config has none). Clients: Authorization: Bearer <key>
API_KEY=

# MCP servers: MCP_<NAME>_URL (+ _API_KEY) adds the server <name>; Authorization: Bearer <key> by default,
# MCP_<NAME>_HEADER=X-API-Key sends the key in that header instead. A server of the same name in the config wins.
MCP_BIBLE_URL=
MCP_BIBLE_API_KEY=
MCP_BIBLE_HEADER=X-API-Key
